  "description": "Test build of Milio as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Milio so Fired Up! marks the allies his spells touch (every Cozy Campfire pulse too) and their next hit sets the enemy ablaze (20-100 magic damage by his level over 1.5 s, at most 100 to monsters) instead of the data pack's +30% attack and ability power; Breath of Life goes out only when an allied champion around him is crowd-controlled, below 30% health or lost 30% within a second, with an enemy champion close, read from their health, and it really cleanses crowd control. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
